error[baked-state]: `NTHREADS` bakes in `Threads.nthreads()` at precompile time
 --> positive.jl:2:18
  |
2 | const NTHREADS = Threads.nthreads()
  |       -------- value stored in precompile cache
  |                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ read when package precompiles
  |
  = why: cache keeps thread count of build session; sessions with other thread count still see it
  = fix: compute in `__init__` and store in `Ref`, or read at call time   [manual]
  = docs: corset explain baked-state
  = note: deny from correctness group, library preset
  = note: opt out with `# corset: allow baked-state -- <reason>`

